%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date 2026-07-28
%% @type flowchart
%% @level system
flowchart TD
    Raw[Raw provider records] --> Map[Field mapping FieldSpec/profile]
    Map --> Norm[Domain normalization profiles]
    Norm --> Id[Identifier family canonicalization]
    Id --> Val[Pandera schema validation]
    Val --> OK{Valid?}
    OK -->|Yes| Domain[Domain entity / row contract]
    OK -->|Soft fail| Soft[Null/flag per policy]
    Soft --> Domain
    OK -->|Hard fail path| Q[Quarantine routing]
    Domain --> Out([Silver write input])
